        "heading": "<p>PROGRESSION FOLLOWS FRICTION</p>",
        "body": "<p>We are inspired by the human instinct to progress. We celebrate rad individuals who explore, experiment, and discover. No matter the circumstance, onward is the mantra for the everyday carrier. </p>",
