        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2023-04-18_141404.png",
        "subtext": "<p>ORIGIN STORY</p>",
        "heading": "<p>ROOTED IN EXPRESSION</p>",
        "body": "<p>In 2015, we stretched ourselves to redefine minimalist carry goods. We took what was once boring black and brown leather wallets and designed our own expressive, minimalist, and functional wallets & accessories. By opening the door to the creative possibilities on a forgotten category we sparked a fire in youth at large and continue to attract artists, athletes, and leaders in indiviuality. Many years later, Thread established its brand mission, Carry On, as a call to any and all that values personal progress and self-expression. With this slogan we are driven to be the go-to all things carry brand. Join us in our mission to empower and inspire others to Carry On.</p>",
